    "text": "By BRYANNA WILLIS ,\n7 hours ago LOGAN — Utah State University has been denied full funding for a second time after presenting its new budget reinvestment plan. During an Executive Appropriations Committee meeting, new university president Brad Mortensen presented a revised version of their budget, including several changes previously requested by the committee. House Speaker... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
